#: ui/main.qml:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Very large fonts may produce odd-looking results. Instead of using a very "
"large font size, consider adjusting the global screen scale."
msgstr ""
"Vrlo veliki fontovi mogu izgledati čudno. Umesto vrlo velike veličine fonta, "
"razmislite o podešavanju globalne razmere ekrana."

#: ui/main.qml:77
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"“Display” fonts are <link url='https://wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Display_typeface'>not intended for use on computer displays</link>, and may "
"produce odd results. Consider using a different font."
msgstr ""
"Fontovi „Display“ <link url='https://wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Display_typeface'>nisu namenjeni za upotrebu na ekranima računara</link> i "
"mogu izgledati čudno. Razmislite o nekom drugom fontu."

#: ui/main.qml:95
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Plasma is not designed to be usable with fonts smaller than 4pt. Size has "
"been reset to 4pt."
msgstr ""
"Plasma nije pravljena za upotrebu sa fontovima manjim od 4 pt. Veličina je "
"resetovana na 4 pt."

#: ui/main.qml:111
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Very small fonts may produce odd-looking results. Instead of using a very "
